<Defs>
    <!-- Default category assignments for vanilla and known third-party food defs.
         Names are plain strings: entries whose mod is absent resolve silently and are skipped.
         Add your own def of this type to default more things into a category.
         Persisted user choices made in the mod settings always win over these. -->

